Rings have a good chance of being generated cursed.  Sokoban has at 
least four rings and there are times and places in Sokoban where you 
want to keep your pets out of areas (while you build up the Animal Farm 
for the Big Push).

So drop the Sokoban rings at the pinch points to the pits or holes and 
your pets will soon point out to you which ones are cursed.

It's not like most rings can be used against you and the tight areas of 
Sokoban are some of the best places to deal with invisible monsters and 
such.

